 base/doc/clsguide.tex | 14 ++++++++++++--
 base/doc/usrguide.tex | 19 ++++++++++---------
 base/ltfloat.dtx      | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++------------
 3 files changed, 43 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

